    "assertion_tested": "A fixed membership-only Mathlib first-order formula Phi(K), interpreted in ZFSet at the initial-ordinal code of any cardinal kappa, is equivalent to independently defined complete filter extension. At regular kappa it is equivalent to the predecessor residual schema. Exact set coding preserves all subsets, families, small-cardinal bounds, filters, ultrafilters, relative intersections and extensions. No existence assertion or object-language ZFC derivation is supplied.",
